{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Garden is a dungeon crawler top-down shooter with rogue-like elements. You will play as another invader of the garden, hoping to uncover the secret within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with just your pistol and rolling skills to start, you will need to scavenge the Gun Garden to find better weapons, extra ammo, tactical equipment, and experience points to level up your stats in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.poster.avif?t=1760048284\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.webm?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.mp4?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore increasingly expansive randomly generated floors, each room containing enemies or treasure. As you progress deeper, there will be more and more environmental hazards to watch out for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies you fight are challenging, and each floor will add more difficult enemies to the roster. Get far enough and you will encounter a Guardian, one of the toughest protectors of the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.poster.avif?t=1760048284\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.webm?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.mp4?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the Gun Garden, and reach the legendary treasure? Or will you become another invader that succumbs to it's defense mechanisms?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673950?t=1760048284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673950?t=1760048284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/b2aa6c86c86582a1840f3d3c39e13bebb53e5f37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760048284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/b2aa6c86c86582a1840f3d3c39e13bebb53e5f37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760048284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Garden is a dungeon crawler top-down shooter with rogue-like elements. You will play as another invader of the garden, hoping to uncover the secret within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with just your pistol and rolling skills to start, you will need to scavenge the Gun Garden to find better weapons, extra ammo, tactical equipment, and experience points to level up your stats in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.poster.avif?t=1760048284\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.webm?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/d5968fa55ff5411adbd744a8faf63f11.mp4?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore increasingly expansive randomly generated floors, each room containing enemies or treasure. As you progress deeper, there will be more and more environmental hazards to watch out for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies you fight are challenging, and each floor will add more difficult enemies to the roster. Get far enough and you will encounter a Guardian, one of the toughest protectors of the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.poster.avif?t=1760048284\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.webm?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/extras/e85cbe953e9bd296f3ee08626db580a4.mp4?t=1760048284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the Gun Garden, and reach the legendary treasure? Or will you become another invader that succumbs to it's defense mechanisms?</p>","developers":["NEETNectar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673950/8c9faa6e1598082a7b742063409bafeb3bdde9e1/header.jpg?t=1760048284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673950/465857439/14698d309cc37ef195be0042f9d79e559df62938/1753413169/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753415993","dash_h264":"https